  "ruleText": "Ahp 103.03 Meetings of the Board of Directors. The board of directors shall meet at least quarterly and more often if business requires.\n\nSource. #7401, eff 11-3-00; ss by #8077, eff 5-1-04; ss by #9517, eff 7-24-09; ss by #12724, eff 2-15-19",
